  (text "Measures the combined current of the motor phases.\nOutput MOT_CURRENT = (abs(I(AOUT1)) + abs(I(AOUT2))) * 1V/A.\nThe current is directly proprtional to the torque.\nEndstop reached if > 600mV >= 20ms"
